  "body": "### Summary\n\nMigration lot LOT-055 (Phase 3 — engine / Flows (`HFRClient`) — fetch → parse → submit → classify ([ADR 0008](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/adr/0008-hfrclient-orchestration-module.md))): AQ client: per-topic check, create, RSS feed + \"new since\" badge; returns every item with its category (hiding Apple for reviewers is app policy, Q-7).\n\n### Scope\n\nAQ client: per-topic check, create, RSS feed + \"new since\" badge; returns every item with its category (hiding Apple for reviewers is app policy, Q-7)\n\n- Module: HFRClient · Difficulty: easy · Priority: low\n- Audit source: D6\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-028 (#56), LOT-071 (#95)\n\n### Blocked by\n\nno lot dependency left, waiting on the open capture(s): #611\n\n### Model\n\nSonnet → Opus\n\n### Spec\n\nNo spec file on `dev-swift` yet (`docs/lots/LOT-055-*.md`).\n\n### PRs\n\nNone recorded.\n\n### Old issue (frozen)\n\n[francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#83](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/issues/83) — read-only history.\n\n### Owner / session\n\n—\n\n### Pending captures\n\n- CAP-aq-listing-and-aq-rss-feed (#133)\n\n(Rows of the Mac capture backlog that name this lot.)\n\n### Status note\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` status cell on 2026-10-27: `blocked`.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
